        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Multi Award Winning Team Patrick Leonard The Dublin 10 Property Specialists are truly delighted to present No. 139 Blackditch Rd to the Dublin 10 Property Market.\r\n\r\n4 BED / 2 BATH EXTENDED END OF TERRACE HOME\r\nMOST SOUGHT AFTER MATURE ENCLAVE OF HOMES\r\nBACK GARDEN WHICH BENEFITS FROM BEING SOUTH FACING\r\n\r\nBlackditch Rd is a most sought after mature enclave of homes tucked away in a secluded position yet with every conceivable amenity on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nThis is an address that buyers may not appreciate until they have visited. It offers all the allure of a peaceful address yet only minutes from the city.\r\n\r\nNo. 139 is sure to impress , investors, first time buyers and parties trading up / down alike. No. 139 offers an excellent floor plan and would make a great family home.\r\n\r\nThe spacious floor plan consists of: Entrance porch, Entrance Hall, Bedroom, living room/ dining room, sun room (currently used as an office), kitchen and extended downstairs bathroom with extra room currently used for storage.\r\n\r\nUpstairs there is a landing and 2 bedrooms to include primary bathroom which has been fully renovated.\r\n\r\nThe features of this home include: Feature fireplace in living room, fitted kitchen with an abundance of base and eye level storage to include all integrated appliances and upgraded fully tiled bathroom with white sanitary ware.\r\n\r\nThe property also features double glazed windows and gas fired central heating.\r\n\r\nOutside there is a vast driveway to front whilst to the rear there is a garden which benefits from southerly sunshine.\r\n\r\nThe location is second to none within minutes of Ballyfermot, Palmerstown, Chapelizod, Inchicore and the Pheonix Park.\r\n\r\nThe property falls into an excellent catchment of both primary and secondary schools making it a real winner with families.\r\n\r\nThe area is further serviced by an excellent bus route making the city centre most accessible.\r\n\r\nThe M50 / M4 Motorways are also close to hand making this a most strategically positioned address.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is strongly advised.\r\n\r\nAll information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have"
      },
